  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Support to Bolivia Programme Partners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the significant need for effective responses to the extreme gender inequality suffered by Bolivian women, this project seeks to support CAFOD partners in improving their understanding of gender inequality and its root causes.  The project will also provide training and accompaniment to CAFOD partners to implement gender policies and to incorporate a gender focus into both their programmes and their institutional practices.  The project will be coordinated and implemented by the Gender Coordinator of CAFOD partner UNITAS.</narrative>
  </description>
